:: OC Zach Brochella 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Listen here. The rules are simple. 11:30, we meet back here. I don’t want to hear you, see you, or deal with whatever nonsense you get up to unless it is urgent. Understand? I’m here to hang out with my friends, not babysit my baby bro.”</span> You protest, claiming Noah is the baby of the family, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You both are babies to me. If it’s important, come find me, otherwise find some other company. And 11:30, back here! If you’re late you’re walking home without pants. Got it?”</span> You blush at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s threat, humiliation being his go-to, and feel pretty sure he isn’t bluffing. You nod, agreeing to his terms. You figure it would be best for you. If you did hang around <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> all night, odds are you’d end up humiliated by him in one way or another. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Good. Well, I’ll see you then. Oh, and try not to make an absolute fool of yourself? If you do, I’ll pretend I don’t know you.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> says, waving as he walks off into the festival.  <span style="Color:LightGreen">Welp, time to explore!</span> <br>
<br>
