:: OC Zach Brochella 3 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 60>>
You walk down the large array of booths and stages set up on the main path as you begin to explore and search around for something to catch your interest.  <span style="Color:LightGreen">Somehow the collection of many different musicians that are preforming on separate little stages along with the constant loud beats of the main stage makes for an actually entertaining musical experience. You feel yourself actually appreciating the mixed melody.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

The food is also pretty good, having been given a free sample of a tiny taco by one food truck vender since you were ‘cute’. While it is a little embarrassing, you wouldn’t turn down the free food and find yourself considering going back to buy some. You also spot a large variety of merchandise and collectables on display. <span style="Color:LightGreen">This is a music lover’s dream!</span> <br>
<br>
You stop by one of the smaller stages where a rock band has gathered quite the little crowd. The music is intense, high energy, and makes you want to jump up and rock out. Which you would, had your attention not been caught by one of the members of the crowd. A boy, probably a few years older than you but younger than <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>, stands near the end of the crowd jumping and dancing around to the music. <br>
<br>
You’re not sure what brought him to your attention. Maybe it’s his high energy and fun, maybe it’s the fact that he’s the first kid close to your age that you’ve seen without their parents,  <span style="Color:pink">or maybe it’s that his baggy shorts slip down with every jump, revealing his checkered red boxers more and more until – slip! – his shorts fall to his ankles!</span> <br>

