<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shit!”</span> The boy says, bending down to pull up his shorts <span style="Color:LightCoral">before losing his balance, tumbling backwards and – by either extremely bad luck or extremely good luck depending on how you view the situation, collides directly into you!</span> <span style="Color:pink">His boxer’d butt hitting you directly in the face! You both fall to the ground as a few nearby dancers laugh and chuckle.</span> The boy quickly stands up and fixes his shorts, looking a little wobbly, before turning to you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry little dude, didn’t-”</span> He pauses, something strange briefly flickering across his face, before he reaches down to help you up. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, sorry about that. Guess I got a bit too into the music. Haha.”</span> The boy laughs, patting the dirt off your back. You laugh, saying it’s fine, though the kid should probably get a belt. <br>

