<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I already got one, though guess it’s more for fashion than keeping them up.”</span> He lifts up his shirt, revealing he is, in fact, wearing a black and metal belt that is very loosely attached to his shorts. If anything, the metal in the belt just makes his shorts hang lower. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Name’s <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zach</span>. Glad to see more youth in the game. Most the dudes here are geezers or college-age posers thinking they're hot stuff.”</span> You introduce yourself, moving to shake his hand, though the kid just looks at you weirdly before laughing and giving you a fist bump. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Who shakes hands these days? Haha, who you here to see, kid?”</span> <br>
