        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Down there is one of those old rock bands. They’re pretty alright, but most of the people that listen to them are geezers who can’t accept that music has changed and refuse to listen to anything from this century. There is also this girl singer down this way. Not really my scene, but heard she’s pretty alright.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zach</span> shrugs, having shown you all of the other places and leaving these two he’s not really interested in for last. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Anything you want to see?”</span> <br>
