                <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wha-!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span> jumps up, quickly pulling sunglasses to his face, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I- I don’t, what are you-?”</span> He blurts out, sounding a bit more energetic than normal, as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zach</span> turns to see what the commotion is. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ummm, eh ehm…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Hart</span> clears his throat, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You must be mistaken. I’m just- I mean, I- I’m off the clock so…”</span> You tilt your head, asking why he’s being weird. <br>
                <br>
                <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whose this geezer?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zach</span> asks, taking a long slurp out of his drink as he eyes your teacher up and down. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wait a second, don’t I know you from somewhere? You an artist or something?”</span> <br>
                <br>
