:: OC Zach Brochella 4 [nobr]

/* Intro */
The sounds of the festival quickly dissipate as you both walk towards the dark, empty playground. While normally a busy attraction, at this hour with all the kids home or asleep, the jungle of metal and plastic is pretty much empty. You briefly get a strange feeling, seeing as this place is so out of the way and out of sight that this entire thing could have been a ploy by <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zach</span> to rob you or something, but when he slips and nearly does the splits while trying to climb up the slide, you figure he’s probably not that dangerous. <br>
<br>
<<if $Dexterity > 5>>
    <strong>[High Dex]</strong>  <span style="Color:LightGreen">You follow behind him, though much more skillfully and manage to get up the slide in a single sprint.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Zach</span> scoffs as you reach the top, calling you a <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“show off”</span>. He then leans against the railing and sighs, looking towards the festival and resting his head on the metal, looking a bit sleepy. <br>
    <br>
